specs/cli-jev/003-cli-jev-workflow-integration/017-deem-search-narrowing-arm/goal.md:122:| Jev verdict for the parent's log (2026-09-29) | Done | `verdict jev: keep K=256 M=256 A=97 B=68 W=78 L=49 F=47 p=0.006330 jev_version=0.6.2 provider=official model=jev-1.13.0`, the same line in `report.json`'s Jev column. The session recounted M 256, A 97, F 47, 3 unstable and 57 abstained from `calls.jsonl` alone, and W minus L is 29, equal to A minus B. The exact one-sided sign test on W 78 and L 49, recomputed in Python, gives p 0.00633034. All four conditions hold: coverage 2560 >= 2304, margin 290 >= 256, p below 0.05 and flips 470 <= 768. The paraphrase probes read `lookup=0/14 ripgrep=8/14 jev=2/14`, reported and never deciding. Source: `W/runs/jev-live-1/stdout.txt`, `W/runs/jev-live-1/out/`, session record |
