.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/README.md:65:+-- generate-trigger-index.mjs    # Publishes the committed trigger index from corpus frontmatter
.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/retrieval/README.md:66:+-- lookup-trigger-index.mjs      # Scores a prompt against the committed index
